        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle, upgrade, and outsmart your enemies in fast-paced, Pac-Man-style stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let auto-play grind coins for you (it’s not as good as you are—trust me), or take control and go for risky, high-reward runs. Team up with allies, dodge quirky enemies, and collect keys to unlock the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Play: Earn coins while you’re away, but don’t expect flawless gameplay—keep it on the safe stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; Deploy Allies: Buy allies, place them strategically, and pass by to trigger their help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pac-Man-Inspired Action: Weave through speeding, shooting, and even flying enemies while hunting keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure-Friendly: Lose only your earnings and allies—jump back in as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New &amp; Improved from the Browser Version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoother controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more welcoming tutorial to get you started</p>",
